WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:03.670
- Good morning, good afternoon,
hello, hi, it's Justine.

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.310
And this is my channel.

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.200
If you guys are new here, welcome.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.330
I have had quite an influx
of subscribers lately,

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:11.980
and it's been super fun.

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:15.210
So to anyone who has joined
my channel from that,

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:17.100
welcome, I am excited that you're here.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.610
I make videos on YouTube,
and I've been doing it

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:24.320
for about 11 years, and sometimes
when I think about that,

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:26.950
it is insane.

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:28.320
It's actually really crazy.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.890
I have a dog.

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:31.870
His name's Matty.

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:33.737
I have an addiction to Amiibo.

00:00:35.303 --> 00:00:37.040
I like video games, I
like food, I like candy.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.940
I like eating pizza a lot.

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:40.350
I'm not a very good cook.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:41.420
But yet I do try.

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:43.123
I really like succulents.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:47.220
I like Star Wars, although I
never saw Star Wars as a kid.

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:49.150
So I like Star Wars as an adult,

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:51.040
having seen the Star Wars movies

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:53.870
and watching them in the
completely wrong order.

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:58.560
Anyway, my point in this
video is I am also a vlogger.

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:00.630
And sometimes when I think about vlogging

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:02.340
and how long I've been vlogging

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:05.090
and how much incredible
content that I have to go back

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:08.060
and to watch is really, really fun.

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:09.860
But recently, I've been
having this feeling

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:12.120
of I don't want to vlog.

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:13.190
It's this weird feeling

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:15.170
where I don't want to film something.

00:01:15.170 --> 00:01:16.560
I don't want to have a camera in my face.

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:18.400
I don't want to have a
camera in my friends' faces,

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.470
which is why my vlogs have been sort

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:22.760
of non-existent, really.

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.670
But today, I'm gonna be
posting a really long vlog,

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:27.929
because these are all
of the vlogs that I've,

00:01:27.929 --> 00:01:29.220
how many times am I gonna say vlog?

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:30.940
I've been filming videos,

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:32.600
but I just haven't been posting them.

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:34.613
So I thought all of those videos and vlogs

00:01:34.613 --> 00:01:38.020
that I have filmed, that are
probably so old, at this point,

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:39.443
I'm just gonna post it all in one video.

00:01:39.443 --> 00:01:41.220
And that's this video.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:43.425
But today, we're gonna start
out with what I do today.

00:01:43.425 --> 00:01:45.940
(laughs) Some of these clips
that you guys are gonna see,

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:47.470
it's from like a month ago.

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:50.160
And I was asking myself,
am I a bad vlogger?

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:53.870
I think you get burned out
making videos, every single day,

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:56.230
about your life, about
the most mundane things.

00:01:56.230 --> 00:01:58.820
And I have so many props to people

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:01.680
who can do this, every single
day, because I just can't,

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:02.930
because at some point,

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:06.660
I actually was living my
life in post-production.

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.510
I still edit almost all of my own videos.

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:12.170
So I will go and do something
super fun and super cool,

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:14.560
and then I'm not really
enjoying it, in the moment.

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:18.440
I enjoy that moment later,
when I'm actually editing,

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:21.930
and I'm making whatever it was
that I did into a fun story,

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:24.050
a fun story that I get to tell you guys,

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:26.280
a fun story of how I want to remember

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:28.060
whatever it was that I was doing.

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:30.370
And I'm so grateful that that is something

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:33.520
that I get to do, but
after doing it for so long,

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:38.250
it does start to sort of affect
how you do things, I guess,

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:39.277
on a daily basis, because you wake up,

00:02:39.277 --> 00:02:42.060
and you say, I don't
have a video for today.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:45.500
What can I go do that will be
cool to make a video about?

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:46.550
And you don't wake up

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:48.340
and say, wow, I'm gonna
go have a great day

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:50.380
and enjoy it and spend it and live it.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:51.630
I'm gonna film it and record it.

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:52.640
I'm not complaining.

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:55.680
I'm just saying it's a different
way that, who I think a lot

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:58.490
of people who make
videos, every single day,

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:02.850
kind of take on their day,
if that makes any sense.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:03.910
So I guess what I've been trying

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:07.670
to do is have more pre-edited
content and having things

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:09.420
where I don't feel so stressed out

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:11.790
that if I wake up, and
I don't have a video,

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:12.750
it's gonna be okay.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.650
I try to post videos,
every day, but lately,

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:16.400
it hasn't been every day.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:19.060
I'd rather post better videos for you

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:21.620
